# UI kutubxona porti

Vazifa: zamonaviy UI elementini loyihaga **tashlab qo‘yish**, qayta dizayn qilmaslik.

## Manba (o‘ylab topma)

1. Aceternity UI — https://ui.aceternity.com/
   - Sidebar: https://ui.aceternity.com/components/sidebar
   - Container Scroll Animation: https://ui.aceternity.com/components/container-scroll-animation
   - Timeline: https://ui.aceternity.com/components/timeline
2. Magic UI — https://magicui.design/
   - Animated Theme Toggler: https://magicui.design/docs/components/animated-theme-toggler
   - Scroll Progress: https://magicui.design/docs/components/scroll-progress
   - Interactive Grid Pattern: https://magicui.design/docs/components/interactive-grid-pattern
3. Vengeance UI — https://www.vengenceui.com/
   - Interactive Particles: https://www.vengenceui.com/docs/components/interactive-particles
   - Stagger Text: https://www.vengenceui.com/docs/components/stagger-text

Boshqa komponent: avval rasmiy sahifa + manba kodni o‘qi. Taxminiy “o‘xshash” UI yozma.

## Yangi kutubxona — avtomatik esla

Foydalanuvchi yangi UI kutubxona yoki komponent URL bersa va u yuqoridagi ro‘yxatda yo‘q bo‘lsa: so‘ramasdan shu faylga qo‘sh (nom + aniq URL + qaysi komponent). Eski qatorlarni o‘chirma. Keyingi chat shu ro‘yxatdan o‘qiydi.

## Port tartibi

1. Rasmiy demo + kodni o‘qi.
2. Muqaddas: o‘lcham, rang, radius, hover, motion egri chizig‘i, ikonka, ochiq/yopiq holat.
3. Stackga mosla (vanilla JS + CSS OK). React/Next/Tailwind’ni majburan o‘rnatma. Framer Motion → CSS transition.
4. Moslashuv FAQAT: 1 ta brend accent, shrift, matn/rasm/link, i18n, mavjud route/nav/data.
5. Koddan oldin 4 qator: URL, nima saqlanadi, nima moslanadi, qaysi fayllar.
6. Tugagach: “kutubxonadan saqlangan” vs “o‘zim yozgan (faqat moslashuv)”.

## Taqiqlangan

- Kutubxonani “chiroyliroq” qilib qayta chizish (rang, layout, radius, shadow, ikonka, easing).
- O‘qilmasa/siqilsa — palitrasini o‘ylab topma. Avval sayt CSS konflikti (overflow, tema ranglari). Faqat shu konfliktni scope qil.
- Dropdown/menyuni `position:fixed` / `overflow:hidden` bilan kesish yoki uchirish. Menyu tugma ostida.
- Hover titrashi. Kengayish: width/opacity, ~0.35–0.4s `cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`; chiqishda qisqa delay.
- Boshqa bo‘limlarga tegish. Olib tashlashda class/script/i18n ni tozalab olib tashla.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` da animatsiyani o‘chir.
- Mobil: kutubxona qanday qilsa (drawer va h.k.) — shuni takrorla.
